{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_04_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-4","storyName":"名为客房区的迷宫","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在艾雅法拉的鼓励下，初华终于决定离开小岛，去寻找祥子。祥子也终于到达了初华的住处，然而两人却阴差阳错地错过了。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["三角初华","艾雅法拉","丰川祥子","？？？","热心的船夫","莫菲丝","若叶睦"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"当重复的事情做了无数次，人总会丧失对其的感知。","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"当重复的一天度过了无数遍，人便会陷入这个循环之中。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"无从自觉，无法自拔。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"就像一个漫长的、无尽的、无解的梦一样。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"伴随着山中羽兽的啼鸣，每天清晨从床上自然地苏醒。","id":22},{"type":"text","text":"倘若想睡个懒觉，也不会有人催促，把头重新埋进被子里就好。","id":23},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"charslot","id":27},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"收拾好被子和床铺，在厨房简单地做一顿早餐。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"煎蛋，面包，牛奶……","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"想吃什么，想喝什么，全凭自己的心意。","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":36},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"charslot","id":38},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_bg_bg_ltroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":40},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"一个人坐在钢琴旁，按下一个琴键，将未调的琴弦一点点调成正确的音调。不知过了多久，再调下一根琴弦。","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"等到调完最后一根琴弦，第一根琴弦的音调又变得不准。","id":44},{"type":"text","text":"于是，如此反复。","id":45},{"type":"dialog","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"38_g21_skystarry_L1/38_g21_skystarry_R1/38_g21_skystarry_L2/38_g21_skystarry_R2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-105","fadetime":"1","id":50},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"720","yTo":"360","block":"false","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"一个人躺在盛夏的草地上，看着一览无余的星空。","id":55},{"type":"text","text":"她知道，即使星星的位置看起来和昨天并无区别，但其实它们一直在永不停歇地变化。","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"两颗现在相邻的星星，即使被人们赋予意义，在千万年后，也会变得无比遥远，毫无瓜葛。","id":57},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"gridbg","id":62},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"text","text":"就和人与人之间的关系一样。","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"今天，她也没有回来。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"在渺无人烟的小岛，仅凭脑海中微弱的记忆，构建一个不可确信的梦。","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"囿于记忆的牢笼，如同人偶一般。","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"执念与悲伤填充着身体，膨胀，膨胀。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"却动弹不得。","id":71},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"一开始，我以为她只是突发奇想，去附近散了散步。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"后来，我从码头工人的口中得知，她那天独自登上了离岛的航船……","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"你为什么不去找她呢？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"这样的一天实在有过太多太多次，多到我不能确认它究竟是否真实。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我……我已经想不起她的模样，也记不起她的名字了。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"也许这就是我的归宿……在这静静地等待。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"subtitle","text":"等待她的归来，抑或是我的死亡。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":97},{"type":"subtitle","text":"悲伤的源泉终有一天会干涸，没有更多的眼泪，便不会再哭泣了。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":98},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这样无人关心的角落，就是我最好的归宿。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":99},{"type":"subtitle","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":101},{"type":"sticker","id":102,"text":"“不行！”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"28","delay":"0","duration":"1","width":"700"},{"type":"sticker","id":103,"duration":"0.5","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#8$2","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"——！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"初华小姐，你在哭，说明你还不想放弃，对吧？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"这不是你想要的结局，对吧？！","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":112},{"type":"multiline","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"至少……","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"multiline","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"至少，应该站在她的面前，表达自己的想法吧。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#7$2","focus":"r","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"……","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"我能听出来的话，她一定也能明白你的心意。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"不用尽全力呐喊，又怎么能传达给她呢？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"连我都能听到你的声音，她肯定也可以的。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#7$2","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"我……可是你的听力状况，我不能留下你一个人——","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"再怎么说，我也是接受过罗德岛训练的干员，你就放心好啦。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"作为本就是萍水相逢的人，初华小姐，你已经为我做了很多事了。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"你该问问自己的内心——现在到底想要做什么？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ed/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"（小声）我想找到她……","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#14$2","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"……没什么。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"初华小姐，我看得懂唇语哦。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":144},{"type":"sticker","id":145,"multi":"true","text":"“看吧，你已无路可逃”","x":"300","y":"220","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":146,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“将逐渐虚弱的你，紧紧关住——”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":147,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“你知晓我渴望……”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":148,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“我渴望……我渴望……”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":149,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n“我如此渴望着你……”","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"srun","id":159},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"srun","fadetime":"2","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"当初华察觉到时，她已经在全力地奔跑了。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"她感到胸腔前所未有地炙热，这种感觉甚至让她有些头晕目眩。","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"而最后的一丝理智，还在不断地质问着她——","id":165},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"subtitle","text":"连名字都记不清，连面貌都想不起……","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":170},{"type":"subtitle","text":"你又如何能在茫茫人海里找到她的身影？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":171},{"type":"subtitle","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"可是我想见到她！","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"无论如何，我都想再次见到她！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"她的声音先她一步，朝心中的方向飞去。","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"而她，正奋力地朝自己声音的方向奔去。","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":184},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"srun","fadetime":"2","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":186},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":187},{"type":"charslot","id":188},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"祥子顺利来到了别墅，这里的一切都跟莫菲丝让她看到的一模一样。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华——","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"一模一样的格局，一模一样的摆件……就连架子上的书都完全一样。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"为什么……","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"地面上一尘不染，厨房里摆满了过量的餐具，还有一张能坐下十多人的长桌。","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"祥子无法想象初华一人生活于此的场景。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"既然是做梦，那就把痛苦的部分丢得一干二净啊……","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"n","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"一定是她觉得，这里对于你们两人来说，都很重要吧。","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":211},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"你就是这栋别墅的主人吧……初华小姐刚刚离开这。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……她去哪里了？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_180_amgoat_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾雅法拉","text":"她终于认清了自己的内心，决心去找你。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_180_amgoat_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"charslot","id":227},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_bg_65_g3_islandharbor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":230,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"你要坐船吗？","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"嗯，我想买张离岛的船票。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"唔，那你得等一会，我还在等另一个乘客。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"那个姑娘怎么还没回来呢……希望她已经找着人了。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4184_dolris_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"没关系的，我可以等……","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4184_dolris_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"初华说到一半，硬生生地将下半句话咽了回去。好在船夫并没有察觉她的异样。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"唉，夜晚海上浪大雾浓，行船不安全。我得为你们的安全着想啊！","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipbell","volume":"1","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"喏，你听信号塔发的信号，那家伙在催我们走呢。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"background","id":257},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_65_i05_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"15","block":"false","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"塔上那个人，他在挥舞旗子……","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"呵，那老酒鬼就指着我每月给他带的啤酒过活。","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"“一路平安，别忘记了——我的啤酒。”","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"热心的船夫","text":"哼，忘记谁的东西，也不能忘记他的那箱美酒啊！","id":266},{"type":"text","text":"船夫说完，一个箭步登上了船。","id":267},{"type":"dialog","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shipwhistle","volume":"1","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"由海面吹来的风，将汽笛声带去小岛的每一个地方。","id":271},{"type":"text","text":"看着这座寄托了美好和痛苦的小岛，初华有太多话想倾诉。","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"三角初华","text":"……别忘记我。","id":273},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"image","id":278},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":280},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":281},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不可能忘记的吧。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":282},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我们从儿时就一起生活在这里。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":283},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我相信，我们一定会再次相见——","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":284},{"type":"subtitle","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":286},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_keeprunning","volume":"1","channel":"step","loop":"true","id":287},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"3","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华——！","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呼……呼……呼……咳咳咳……","id":291},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"background","id":296},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_65_i05_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华——初华——！","id":301},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_harbor_busy","volume":"0.8","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"祥子的声音已经沙哑。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"海浪一遍遍拍打着海岸，没有回声。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"返航的船已经驶离。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"现在，只留她一人独守于此。","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":311},{"type":"charslot","id":312},{"type":"image","id":313},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_bg_65_g4_islandharbor_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_strangeclap","volume":"1","id":317},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"等待了无数个日夜的少女，终于决心启程寻找自己的伙伴。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"没想到却在最后一刻错过……啧啧啧，好可惜哟。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"说实话，我没想到她会选择离开。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"在我给她预设的结局里，她应该会忘掉关于你的一切，然后在这度过安逸无忧的一生。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不过现在看来，我有点低估你对她的影响了。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我得承认，这局我们平手。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":332},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"可惜的是，以那艘航船的速度，她就快要遇到海难了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"什么……？","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":339,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"为你们建造这整个岛已经够累了，难道还要我把整个泰拉造出来，让你们的苦情戏码在整片大地上一遍遍地上演？","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"船马上要开到梦境的边际了，然后她就会落入下一次的梦境。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"一次次循环，一次次重置。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"她终会忘记你的存在。","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不行，我要想办法追上她——","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"已经没有时间了。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"charslot","id":353},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"祥子感到自己脚下一阵冰凉，不知何时，海水已经漫过脚踝。","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"大海与天空的连接处已经被阴云笼罩，其中时不时闪着刺眼的光芒。","id":358},{"type":"dialog","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.3","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华——！","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"海水像疯了一样不断地上涨，祥子感到有什么正在将自己往深渊里拖拽。","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华——等着我！","id":364},{"type":"dialog","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"charslot","id":368},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_49_g12_diving.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":370},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_underwtr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"u","id":371},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"u","fadetime":"2","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"text","text":"幽暗，冰冷，窒息。","id":374},{"type":"text","text":"海水压迫着鼓膜，残存在胸腔中的氧气渐渐稀薄，就和头顶越来越微弱的光一样。","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"视线愈发模糊，咸苦的海水从无法紧闭的嘴中涌入，试图侵占最后的意识。","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"就这样，就这样，一直下坠。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"直到海底，暗无天日之处。","id":378},{"type":"dialog","id":379},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"u","fadetime":"2","id":380},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":381},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":382},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2.5","block":"true","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":386},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"“祥……”","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"“祥……祥……”","id":389},{"type":"text","text":"一个声音，正从无法辨听的方向靠近。","id":390},{"type":"dialog","id":391},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这是哪？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":392},{"type":"subtitle","text":"是谁在叫我？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":393},{"type":"subtitle","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"快……快……快醒醒……","id":396},{"type":"text","text":"熟悉的声音，许久未闻的声音。","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"冰冷潮湿的海底已经消失得无影无踪，取而代之的是干燥的地面，还有四处纷飞的沙尘。","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"是谁……","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_65_i06.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"cg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":406},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":407,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"祥子努力睁开双眼，一缕浅色的头发映入眼帘。","id":410},{"type":"dialog","id":411},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":412},{"type":"cg","duration":"2","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"祥，你还好吗？","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……睦？","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"若叶睦","text":"嗯，我在。","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"再简单不过的一句话，却让祥子的眼泪夺眶而出。","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"她确信不是飞沙的缘故，因为只有她自己知道，此刻她的内心有多么无助。","id":419},{"type":"text","text":"她已无暇顾及自己一开口便会哽咽，她只想抓住唯一的那根稻草。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"睦……我……该怎么办……","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":423},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":424},{"type":"charslot","id":425},{"type":"image","id":426}],"characters":["三角初华","艾雅法拉","丰川祥子","？？？","热心的船夫","莫菲丝","若叶睦"]}